<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sunny, warm weather.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sunny, warm weather.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Tuesday were forecast to see sunny, warm weather, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sunny skies and highs of 21 to 24 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see mainly sunny skies with highs of 22 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sunny skies with highs of 30 Celsius.</p>
<p>((--Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
